    "correctAnswer": "A",
    "explanation": "Under General Auditing Principles & Auditor Responsibilities (SA 200-299), as per the official ICAI Case Scenario Booklet guidance.",
    "reference": "ICAI May 2026 Booklet Case Scenario 13; General Auditing Principles & Auditor Responsibilities (SA 200-299)"
