        "text": "The auditor’s opinion shall not refer to the corresponding figures \nexcept if the previous period audit report is other than an \nunqualified opinion or the auditor has sufficient evidence that a \nmaterial misstatement exists in the financial statement of prior \nperiod which was not addressed earlier."
